                  <span class="mini__eyebrow">Clean, fast, ready</span>
                  <span class="mini__headline">A premium site<br />people trust.</span>
                  <span class="mini__sub">Clear pages, real calls to action, and mobile-first lead capture.</span>
                  <span class="mini__btn">Start a project</span>
